       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ORDER-MAIN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY "order-data.cpy".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 900001 TO ORDER-ID.
           MOVE "NOTEBOOK" TO ITEM-NAME.
           MOVE 12000 TO UNIT-PRICE.
           MOVE 3 TO ORDER-QUANTITY.

           PERFORM CALCULATE-ORDER-AMOUNT.
           CALL "TAXCALC" USING ORDER-AMOUNT TAX-AMOUNT.
           COMPUTE TOTAL-AMOUNT = ORDER-AMOUNT + TAX-AMOUNT.
           PERFORM DISPLAY-ORDER.
           STOP RUN.

       CALCULATE-ORDER-AMOUNT.
           COMPUTE ORDER-AMOUNT = UNIT-PRICE * ORDER-QUANTITY.

       DISPLAY-ORDER.
           DISPLAY "注文ID = " ORDER-ID.
           DISPLAY "商品名 = " ITEM-NAME.
           DISPLAY "単価 = " UNIT-PRICE.
           DISPLAY "数量 = " ORDER-QUANTITY.
           DISPLAY "金額 = " ORDER-AMOUNT.
           DISPLAY "税額 = " TAX-AMOUNT.
           DISPLAY "合計 = " TOTAL-AMOUNT.
